<title>LATVIA: PAREKS BANKA ASSETS IN FIRST HALF 214 MLN LATS.</title>
<headline>PAREKS BANKA ASSETS IN FIRST HALF 214 MLN LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvia's largest bank Pareks Banka said on Wednesday that its assets by the end of the first half of the year were at 214.39 million lats.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement that its assets included credits to businesses of 41.04 million lats and to private financial institutions of 12.84 million lats.</p>
<p>The bank also said it had deposits by companies of 103.99 million lats and individuals' deposits of 23.99 million lats.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
